{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":52,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝的審判和慈愛"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["以東人多益去告訴掃羅：「大衛到了亞希米勒家。」那時大衛作了這首訓誨詩，交給樂長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"勇士啊，你為何以作惡為榮？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝的慈愛永遠長存。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這詭詐的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舌頭利如剃刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盡是害人的奸計。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你喜愛邪惡，不愛良善；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你喜愛虛謊，不愛真理。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你有詭詐的舌頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好說惡言惡語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝必永遠毀滅你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必抓住你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你從家裡拉出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從活人之地剷除。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"義人看見必心生敬畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必嘲笑說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，這就是不依靠上帝的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他只倚仗自己的財富並靠作惡得勢。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我就像上帝殿中的一棵橄欖樹，枝繁葉茂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我永永遠遠信靠上帝的慈愛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要永遠讚美你的作為。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在你忠心的子民面前仰望你美善的名。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}